        "Write the original short prompt, then answer:\n1. What outcome do I actually want?\n2. Who is the output for?\n3. What information does AI need?\n4. What method should it follow?\n5. What would make the result excellent?\n6. What should it avoid?\n7. How should it present the result?\n8. How will I evaluate it?\nUse those answers to write a more complete instruction set."
