        "QUALITY STANDARDS\nThe prompt should:\n- Follow the supplied method accurately.\n- Use my context rather than generic assumptions.\n- Explain important decisions.\n- Ask questions instead of guessing when key information is missing.\n- Identify uncertainty and unsupported claims.\n- Follow my constraints and preferred output format.\n- Include a quality-control checklist.\n- Be practical and easy to reuse.",
