        "Then produce the complete reusable prompt in a clean, copy-ready format.\n3.4 Why the context-gathering phase is essential\nSuppose you have a detailed guide to writing a landing page. The guide may explain headline structure, customer pain points, benefits, proof, objections, and calls to action.",
