        "Examples include:\n- Drafting a landing page.\n- Organising research.\n- Producing a content outline.\n- Converting notes into a structured document.\n- Creating a project plan.\nThe executor needs clear instructions and a defined output format. It should not be given unnecessary freedom to invent facts or change the objective.\n4.6 Choose the right mode\n| Mode | Main purpose | Best use |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Coach | Develop your capability over time | Learning a skill or completing a multi-stage goal |\n| Advisor | Help evaluate a decision | Business, career, or project decisions |\n| Thought partner | Improve your reasoning | Complex ideas, writing, strategy, and problem-solving |\n| Executor | Complete a defined task | Drafting, organising, analysis, and production |",
